      "snippet": "Memory is a powerful backend service designed to enhance AI clients like Cursor, Claude, and Windsurf by providing them with long-term memory capabilities. It allows these clients to persistently remember user preferences, behaviors, and contextual information across conversations, moving beyond keyword matching to truly understand and retrieve relevant memories based on meaning. Built on Cloudflare's robust infrastructure including Workers, D1, Vectorize, Durable Objects, Workers AI, and Agents, Memory offers a scalable, secure, and cost-effective solution for creating more intelligent and personalized AI experiences.",
