figs, permissions) coming in v2.\n\n## START NOW\n\nOne command to install. One home for all your agent configs. Enable tasks and history when you need them.\n`$ brew install dot-agents/tap/dot-agents`STAR ON GITHUBREAD DOCSSETUP2minLICENSEMIT100%LOCAL",
