      "snippet": "## bytecodecrux\n\n##### Aug 04, 2025 (0:04:45)\nLearn how to write effective Claude.md files that transform your AI coding assistant from generic helper to project-aware expert. Stop explaining the same project rules and preferences over and over.\n\nIn this tutorial, I show you how to configure Claude Code using claude.md files based on Anthropic's official best practices. You'll learn what to include, where to place these files, and how to iterate and improve your configurations\n\n…\n\n{ts:180} Now  here's  a  common  mistake.  Adding \n extensive  content  without  iterating  on\n{ts:185} \n effectiveness. \n\n{ts:187} Your  Claude.md  files  become  part  of \n Claude's  prompts,  so  they  should  be\n{ts:192} \n refined  like  any  frequently  used  prompt.",
